  "description": "Do-Yeon and Eun-Ha, who became a family due to their parents' remarriage, become strangers again due to their parents' divorce. When the two meet again after many years. Eun-Ha is obsessed with Do-Yeon, and Do-Yeon is burdened by his younger brother... What's even worse is that his feelings for Eun-Ha are not 'brotherly love'.\n\n(Source: KakaoPage, translated)",
